-- 033_student_gender.sql
-- Date: 2026-10-19
-- FIXES_14102026_TASK.md №7: the "İnkişaf edən şagird" certificate shows a boy for every student.
-- Girls get a girl variant of the template (034), which needs the student's gender.
--
-- Gender is not in the customer's files. It was inferred on a prod copy of 2026-10-19
-- (5780 students) from the full name: the given name first (a manual dictionary plus the
-- name's majority gender across the base), the surname suffix (-ova/-eva vs -ov/-ev) as a
-- fallback. 74 uncertain cases were set by the owner's rules and listed for manual review
-- (db-dumps/student-gender-review-2026-10-19.csv, outside git: it holds full names).
-- Students created after that export stay NULL here; the import infers theirs (studentResult.service.pg.ts).
-- NULL = unknown, rendered like 'm' (the original boy template).
